<title>NEW ZEALAND: RTRS-TABLE-FCL Forest lifts yr net profit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-TABLE-FCL Forest lifts yr net profit.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-08-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fletcher Forests year result</p>
<p>to June 30.</p>
<p>(NZ$ million)</p>
<p>					   current	    previous</p>
<p>					   period     corresponding period</p>
<p>					    153		   74</p>
<p>Note - Fletcher Forests Ltd. Market expectations - net profit of NZ$60-65 million (before abnormal items). FCL Forests said the year's result included one-off contributions of NZ$84 million, mainly due to the sale of forests less costs associated with the purchase of Forestry Corp of NZ. Without the benefit of  </p>
<p>these gains, net earnings would have been marginally down on the previous year's result, FCL said.</p>
</text>
